# U41: the search filter with an "or" pattern (matchOrPattern's `|` split: "shocked|chilled"
# shows the options whose label matches either), so the matching options of every section pack
# at the top; hover "Is the enemy Shocked?" (a check the fixture sets: the "Toggling this option
# will give you:" compare through the bridge) and untick it; collapse "For Effective DPS" with
# its "-" toggle while the search is active (IsSectionCollapsed: a search keeps it open), then
# clear the search with the edit's clear button (changeFunc -> UpdateControls): the collapsed
# section shows only its header.
#! u41-expect-absent name="conditionEnemyShocked"
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
move 400 91
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press RETURN
frames 3
key-down CTRL
press 5
key-up CTRL
frames 3
move 500 75
click LEFTBUTTON
type "shocked|chilled"
frames 3
move 573 151
frames 3
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
snapshot unshocked
move 676 106
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 670 77
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 900 600
frames 2
